    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d518">

                <pb facs="0478" n="362" xml:id="pg362"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 738.3915/129.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister to Haiti</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 9, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>You will visit the Pedernales region, carefully investigate and report fully,
                    bearing in mind the desirability of restoring the status quo at the time of
                    acceptance of the good offices of this Government, which would imply occupation
                    by the Dominican civil authorities of the section east of Pedernales as well as
                    certain points between Lake Fondo and the headwaters.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
